  "body": "- Add a Gradio-based web application in the `chat/` directory to enable interactive chat with the HRM model.\r\n- Create a CLI test script `chat/test_cli.py` for debugging model responses without the UI.\r\n- Refactor model loading logic to be runnable from a standalone app.\r\n- Fix various issues discovered during testing, including module import paths, incorrect class initializations (`nn.Buffer`, `ACTLossHead`), and handling of missing dependencies (`flash-attn`).\r\n- Add `utils/__init__.py` to ensure the utils directory is treated as a package.",
